# Debugging Ephemeral Rollups

Use this when an Ephemeral Rollups transaction fails, an account appears delegated
but is rejected as writable, the app might be using the wrong ER endpoint, or a
private/eATA flow returns a misleading balance or validator-mismatch error.

## Contents

- [Endpoint Selection](#guide-debugging--endpoint-selection)
- [Router `getDelegationStatus`](#guide-debugging--router-getdelegationstatus)
- [Healthy Delegation Shape](#guide-debugging--healthy-delegation-shape)
- [Fast Investigation Runbook](#guide-debugging--fast-investigation-runbook)
