(`mainnet`, `devnet`, `mainnet-private`, `devnet-private`, or a custom base RPC URL). On 2026-10-20
everything on upstream `main` through #148 was live for both devnet and mainnet:

| Feature (upstream PR) | Live? | Evidence |
